<article class="env-lemma" id="01V2">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01V2">Lemma <span data-tag="01V2">29.33.12</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to S$ be a morphism of schemes. If $f$ is locally of finite type, then $\Omega _{X/S}$ is a finite type $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Immediate from Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/00RZ" data-tag="00RZ">10.131.16</a>, Lemma <a href="/tag/01UT" data-tag="01UT">29.33.5</a>, Lemma <a href="/tag/01T2" data-tag="01T2">29.15.2</a>, and Properties, Lemma <a href="/tag/01PB" data-tag="01PB">28.17.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>